WEBVTT

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:11.720
Don't move.

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:15.680
If you move, God's Light
will die, here and now.

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:42.910
Yuki!

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:49.670
Only I know your pain...

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:51.750
Your uncertainty...

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:55.030
Your loneliness...

00:00:56.310 --> 00:01:00.600
If only we could be together forever.

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:06.650
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:16.910
I will not betray you!

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:05.510
Master...

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:15.640
Luka...

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:27.160
Wait.

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:31.440
Why are you always trying
to finish things alone?

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:33.790
What are we to you?

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:35.630
Aren't we your friends?

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:38.880
Let's all go together.

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:44.340
Takashiro-sama should
be able to trace Yuki.

00:03:48.110 --> 00:03:53.080
Traitors' Battle

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:03.650
Okay, everyone. Looks like none
of your injuries are severe.

00:04:04.150 --> 00:04:07.570
You didn't need to do all that just for this.

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:10.530
You have to take proper care of yourself.

00:04:10.530 --> 00:04:13.410
The real battle is just beginning.

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:16.170
Do you have any other injuries?

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:20.400
No, I'm fine. Thanks, Aya-chan.

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:24.920
This is the least I can do.

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:27.750
That's not true.

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:30.130
We can fight as hard as we do

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:31.990
because we know you're waiting for us!

00:04:31.990 --> 00:04:32.470
Yeah.

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:34.450
It's true.

00:04:35.260 --> 00:04:38.460
We fight because there are
those we want to protect.

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:40.100
Right, Kuroto?

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:41.400
Yeah.

00:04:44.980 --> 00:04:48.930
Come on. You should get checked
out, too, Luka-kun.

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:51.410
I would very much like to examine you.

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:54.700
I'm fine.

00:04:58.310 --> 00:04:59.820
Yuki was taken by Reiga?

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:00.930
Yes.

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:03.940
And...

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:06.040
What is it, Fuyutoki?

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:10.680
According to the Zweilts,

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:15.720
Reiga appeared to protect
Yuki during the battle.

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:17.930
Reiga protected Yuki?

00:05:17.930 --> 00:05:18.680
Yes.

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:29.990
Yuki, where are you?

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:33.680
But why would Reiga do that for Yuki?

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:38.120
I wonder if Kanata is still
inside Reiga somewhere.

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:42.520
Could Yuki be suffering because
he can't fully acknowledge

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:43.870
Reiga is his enemy?

00:05:43.870 --> 00:05:46.040
Probably, yes.

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:50.800
Damn it!

00:05:51.730 --> 00:05:54.380
Why does he have to suffer?

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:00.760
Takashiro-sama!

00:06:13.860 --> 00:06:16.620
Everyone, you fought well.

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:20.990
Unfortunately, Yuki has fallen
into enemy hands.

00:06:21.780 --> 00:06:24.160
I will locate Reiga.

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:28.130
We will rescue Yuki!

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:40.640
What could Reiga-sama
possibly be thinking?

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:44.560
We should just kill that brat.

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:49.260
Is there a reason we cannot?

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:51.490
Or is this nothing more than a whim?

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:54.900
Well, it certainly is interesting.

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:56.860
I just want to fight.

00:06:57.800 --> 00:07:00.460
I just want to kill them all!

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:06.750
I do wish he'd let us play a little more.

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:27.440
I have robbed you of your freedom.

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:36.930
Why?

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:41.870
Killing me should be easy for you.

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:45.440
I still have a use for you.

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:47.040
Is that all?

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:54.880
Are you sure it's not because
Kanata-san is still inside you...

00:07:55.670 --> 00:07:58.630
And you just don't want to kill me?

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:00.840
And if I said that were true?

00:08:03.090 --> 00:08:06.680
Would you betray the Giou Clan
and ally yourself with me?

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:09.600
That's...

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:13.440
Humans are disgusting.

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:18.780
As we speak, the world is slowly
moving toward destruction.

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:24.170
Meteorological abnormalities caused
by environmental pollution, hunger,

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:27.210
terrorism, and wars driven
by racism and religion.

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:32.500
Humans are foolish
and deeply sinful creatures.

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:35.920
I have a belief.

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:41.130
People may not be able to live without
betraying and hurting others.

00:08:41.130 --> 00:08:45.220
But kindness and warmth,
emotions and courage...

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:48.900
These important things come
from people, as well.

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:52.810
You think you know people like this?

00:08:53.310 --> 00:08:54.270
Yes.

00:08:54.270 --> 00:08:56.450
Luka and the members of the Giou Clan.

00:08:57.140 --> 00:08:59.950
And you, too, Kanata-san.

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:09.200
Nothing could replace the days we spent
together at the Asahi Orphanage.

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:12.290
Those days will never disappear
from inside me.

00:09:12.890 --> 00:09:16.170
Do you feel differently, Kanata-san?

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:21.680
I told you, I abandoned the
name Wakamiya Kanata.

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:26.950
I abandoned it the moment
you became God's Light.

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:40.320
Takashiro-sama...

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:45.120
Where are you, Reiga? Where could you be?

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:54.960
There you are!

00:09:59.610 --> 00:10:02.050
Takashiro-sama! Takashiro-sama!

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:10.140
Is Takashiro-sama all right?

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:14.240
He has been pushing himself
quite hard lately.

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:16.540
We should believe in Takashiro.

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:17.610
Yeah.

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:20.530
Brother!

00:10:22.360 --> 00:10:24.410
I have a message from Takashiro-sama.

00:10:24.410 --> 00:10:26.350
He has found a path.

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:31.760
The Zweilts are to go to
Yuki-san immediately.

00:10:33.410 --> 00:10:35.210
How is the boss doing?

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:38.840
It seems Takashiro-sama
will accompany you.

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:40.210
Let's go, Luka.

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:50.140
They're here.

00:10:52.570 --> 00:10:55.240
Looks like this won't be so boring, after all.

00:10:55.730 --> 00:10:57.310
Let's get this started!

00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:04.040
We lured them into our territory.

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:06.570
Stay there and watch,

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:10.700
as the humans you trust so much suffer.

00:11:12.260 --> 00:11:14.610
Is Yuki in there?

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:21.420
Yeah. I can just barely
sense Yuki's presence.

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:24.290
This place is brimming with demonic power.

00:11:25.310 --> 00:11:28.100
Looks like we won't have the
advantage in this fight.

00:11:28.100 --> 00:11:29.250
Yeah.

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:30.720
Be careful, everyone.

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:33.430
Yuki.

00:11:33.930 --> 00:11:36.220
Okay! Let's go!

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:37.120
Wait!

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:39.650
Someone's here to meet us.

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:44.940
I've been waiting for you.

00:11:44.940 --> 00:11:46.470
It's you.

00:11:47.380 --> 00:11:49.950
We'll handle these guys. Go!

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:51.550
Got it.

00:11:51.550 --> 00:11:52.500
Thanks.

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:53.380
Let's go, Tsukumo!

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:54.200
Okay.

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:14.030
Let's do this!

00:12:14.030 --> 00:12:16.970
Don't expect this to be anything
like last time!

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:19.700
What?

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:30.960
Be careful. He's much more
powerful than before.

00:12:40.680 --> 00:12:43.100
I've been waiting for you, Zess.

00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:45.650
I don't have time for you.

00:12:45.650 --> 00:12:48.520
Oh! You're always in such a hurry.

00:12:48.520 --> 00:12:51.150
Why don't we have some fun together?

00:12:51.150 --> 00:12:53.850
Luka, go! We'll take care of this.

00:12:53.850 --> 00:12:54.610
Yeah.

00:12:56.280 --> 00:12:58.600
I don't have any business with two novices.

00:13:00.680 --> 00:13:04.000
Won't you play with me, Zess?

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:05.330
I won't let you do that!

00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:12.580
You really are insolent brats.

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:14.050
Toko... Tsukumo...

00:13:14.490 --> 00:13:15.630
Leave it to us.

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:21.800
Let's go, Kuroto.

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:23.060
Yeah.

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:27.560
You'll pay for this.

00:13:35.850 --> 00:13:37.010
Cadenza!

00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:42.390
Can you fight him?

00:13:42.390 --> 00:13:44.980
You don't need to worry about us.

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:46.540
Hurry and find Yuki.

00:13:47.560 --> 00:13:48.600
Be careful!

00:13:52.820 --> 00:13:54.880
You want to be beaten again,

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:57.890
Zweilts of the Black Sword
and the Death Scythe?

00:13:58.710 --> 00:13:59.970
We'll see about that.

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:01.260
What?

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:07.340
I always fought for revenge,
but this time, it's different.

00:14:07.340 --> 00:14:10.560
We came here to rescue our friend.

00:14:11.020 --> 00:14:13.150
We won't lose to you today!

00:14:17.930 --> 00:14:20.990
Then let us fight.

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:30.670
Everyone...

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:44.810
You won't save God's Light!

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:45.930
Yeah, right!

00:14:45.930 --> 00:14:48.020
We will rescue Yuki!

00:14:50.220 --> 00:14:55.320
Don't stand in our way! We
will save Yuki-chan!

00:14:55.320 --> 00:14:56.230
Yeah.

00:15:04.280 --> 00:15:06.120
You will never succeed!

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:19.360
I see. This certainly does seem
different from last time.

00:15:21.240 --> 00:15:22.470
We told you!

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:25.680
We will save Yuki-kun!

00:15:39.550 --> 00:15:40.530
Luka!

00:15:41.090 --> 00:15:42.700
Are you all right, Yuki?

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:44.500
Yes.

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:47.910
Release Yuki!

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:55.630
Will both of you traitors stay together
until the end of time?

00:15:56.950 --> 00:15:59.000
Traitors... Both of us?

00:15:59.630 --> 00:16:05.260
That man betrayed his own
blood and chose you.

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:10.430
You will experience the extent
of your guilt firsthand.

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:26.570
Things will be different this time.

00:16:28.110 --> 00:16:29.440
<i>Lufen!</i>

00:16:31.930 --> 00:16:34.500
<i>I am the keeper of the Key of Raziel.</i>

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:40.500
<i>He who carries the burden of
the jewel in his forehead.</i>

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:45.220
<i>He who dwells in the abyss
blacker than darkness.</i>

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:48.640
<i>Come, Vouivre.</i>

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:53.230
<i>Listen to your dark master.</i>

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:59.730
<i>Obey me, and your powers
will be resurrected.</i>

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:02.240
<i>Come, beast.</i>

00:17:02.780 --> 00:17:04.400
<i>Salamander!</i>

00:17:09.870 --> 00:17:11.180
Wh-What was that?

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:13.290
What?

00:17:15.610 --> 00:17:17.250
What's going on up there?

00:17:38.580 --> 00:17:39.310
Sodom!

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:44.990
<i>Swift and enraged...</i>

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:50.040
<i>Awaken your powers, and
turn your body to flame,</i>

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:51.030
<i>to defeat your enemy!</i>

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:13.930
Yuki...

00:18:14.560 --> 00:18:15.810
Sodom.

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:17.880
I'll save...

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:21.600
Sodom!

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:32.070
<i>He who writhes in darkness,</i>

00:18:32.070 --> 00:18:34.620
<i>devour everything, with
all your strength!</i>

00:18:36.820 --> 00:18:38.540
<i>Medeus Gildren!</i>

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:40.860
<i>Izabod!</i>

00:18:46.340 --> 00:18:49.800
You thought defeating Vouivre
meant you'd won?

00:18:51.510 --> 00:18:55.100
We are inside the barrier I created.

00:18:58.310 --> 00:19:00.930
<i>I call on darkness without
compassion,</i>

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:03.520
<i>on light stained by misery.</i>

00:19:04.310 --> 00:19:10.490
<i>Obey my power and stern will,
and appear before me.</i>

00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:15.450
<i>Light, become a sword of
eternal power, and go!</i>

00:19:16.240 --> 00:19:19.710
<i>Turn this frozen mist into
a wall and protect me!</i>

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:32.260
<i>Selefty Blast!</i>

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:35.930
<i>Ifreet Wall!</i>

00:20:03.610 --> 00:20:07.020
How does it feel to be injured
by your own spell?

00:20:11.590 --> 00:20:15.050
The reflected spell did such damage.

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:18.430
He's still powerful even inside my barrier.

00:20:20.930 --> 00:20:23.330
I'll have to kill you here.

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:24.770
Please don't!

00:20:27.380 --> 00:20:30.010
Please don't do this anymore!

00:20:30.010 --> 00:20:31.440
Quiet.

00:20:33.230 --> 00:20:34.990
Humans are disgusting.

00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:41.000
You have chosen those humans.

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:42.370
I have no compassion for you.

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:48.540
I will let you die peacefully.

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:49.340
Yuki!

00:20:58.340 --> 00:21:01.020
Pain, pain, go away!

00:21:02.640 --> 00:21:05.060
Know the pain of being a traitor!

00:21:05.900 --> 00:21:08.190
Yuki!

00:21:20.140 --> 00:21:22.200
Calm yourself, Fowler.

00:21:24.610 --> 00:21:26.540
Why did you interfere, Luze?

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:29.940
I do not intend to disobey my master's will.

00:21:29.940 --> 00:21:33.780
I had simply heard that
God's Light is essential

00:21:33.780 --> 00:21:35.220
to achieving our goals.

00:21:40.380 --> 00:21:41.220
Luze.

00:21:46.390 --> 00:21:48.350
Good to see you again, Luka.

00:21:48.350 --> 00:21:51.400
Or should I call you "brother"?

00:21:52.470 --> 00:21:53.980
Brother?

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:56.780
Is this man

00:21:58.080 --> 00:21:59.490
Luka's younger brother?

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:36.850
Yuki, shiritori!

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:38.190
Sodom, you want to play shiritori?

00:23:38.190 --> 00:23:41.210
Yeah! I'll go first. -Sodom.-

00:23:41.210 --> 00:23:42.570
-Mu,- huh? Let's see...

00:23:42.570 --> 00:23:43.820
Oh, -Murasame!-

00:23:43.820 --> 00:23:45.010
-Melon!-

00:23:45.790 --> 00:23:49.660
Connected Hearts
